      <p source="#source-448-471"><seg source="#source-448-463">ベッタラコ</seg><choice source="#source-463-469"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></p>
      <p source="#source-471-518">「十五夜お月さんにそなへましょ</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-518-556"><seg source="#source-518-556">お月のやうにまるくして</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-556-591"><seg source="#source-556-591">それを見てゐる人々の</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-591-632">心もまるくいたしましょ」</p>
      <p source="#source-632-661"><seg source="#source-632-661">歌を歌って手拍子を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-661-696"><seg source="#source-661-696">とってをどって餅をつく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-696-731"><seg source="#source-696-731">はたらき者のウサギさん</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-731-779" style="padding-inline-end: 1em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-761-779"><seg source="#source-761-779">（七・一三）</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
